      "content": "ok cool. i'll try the mouthguard and maybe some muscle relaxants. i really just want to avoid the hospital or anything like that, it's such a hassle and i'm pretty sure it's nothing serious since it's just my jaw. i'll just keep an eye on it for a few days. what's a safe amount of muscle relaxant to take if the tension gets really bad tonight?",
